// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Angelo_Vendetti 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Angelo Vendetti 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3967935347" "Angelo Vendetti"
// ProfessionString :
"P445445244" "Vengeful Fixer"
// DescriptionString :
"P211997035" "Angelo Vendetti is the scion shattered family of crime that can trace it's origins back to the days of the Medeccis. The Vendetti Family came to ruin nearly 60 years ago, when the charismatic mutant known as 'The Center' plundered their criminal empire for money to split from the old Arachnos and found the criminal organization called the Council. The Vendettis have sworn vengance, and have worked against the Council and it's leader for nearly 60 years. Angelo is the youngest of the line to take up the fight, and is looking to make his first strikes against his family's ancestral foe."
// HelloString :
"P534138177" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Don't look right at me. The Council has spies everywhere.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2162054047" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have a new plan against the Council.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P946799962" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I got some information on the Council.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1243886025" "Do I know you? I didn't think so. You're nothing in this town. If you want to change that, you should look up a broker. They're on the map."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1578682071" "All right, {VillainName}, here's the deal: <br><br>You don't know me and I don't know you. If you've come to me, then it means you got it in for the Council, and I like to hear that, because I have it in for the Council. My family has been fighting the Council ever since they ruined us 60 years ago. I plan to ruin them one day, and to do that, I need the assistance of capable contractors, such as yourself."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P164480865" "The Council's onto me. I have to lay low for a while. We probably shouldn't talk again, for both our safety."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2004064584" "You come to me and you still have all this other stuff on your shoulders? You finish what you started, and talk to me then."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1503454129" "I have to lay low for a while until the Council's spies lay off. Talk to me again in a bit."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2040877630" "We've had a few successes. The Council has to be feeling some pressure. To keep that pressure on, you'll want to outfit yourself with a few new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a> Call me whenever you need to. "
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3764925697" "You, you got what it takes. We can do <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>business.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3294338081" "Why are you talking to me? With your kind of power, you'll attract too much attention."
// LocationString :
"P3345659944" "Port Oakes"
// IntroString :
"P1020300977" "Angelo Vendetti is a man with a very dangerous family grudge. Rumors say his family were ousted from the Italian crime families when the Council came to power, after being deceived into helping them by the Center, the Council's mysterious leader. Arachnos and the Council have a long history of hostility, so the local authorities look the other way when Vendetti recruits people for his personal war."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2751844588" "Choose Angelo Vendetti"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4003641274" "Vendetti's the kind of guy who's too driven to cheat you. But keep an eye out. He could get you into a lot of trouble."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P754425269" "I know somebody, and they've been asking about you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2359715644" "There are some people I know who've been asking about you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


