// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Billie Heck 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4137203786" "Billie Heck"
// ProfessionString :
"P1806910968" "Street Fixer"
// DescriptionString :
"P3401355795" "Billie Heck showed up in Port Oakes a short while ago. After unsuccessfully trying to start up his own gang, he became an errand boy for the Family. Now he claims to be a street fixer for the Family, occasionally hooking up freelancers for certain jobs that the Family doesn't want to handle themselves."
// HelloString :
"P681296081" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hey, man.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1512419091" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hi.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2276673844" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>What up?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3746268593" "What do you want? You want to talk to me, you got to build up your rep, see? Try talking to a broker. They're on the map."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1543461026" "Yo, I'm Billie Heck. I know stuff about the Family in this area, including some jobs that need doin'.  If yer interested, let me know."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1168825294" "I got nothin' for ya. Go bug someone else."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1061927886" "You got enough goin' on, {VillainName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1889851987" "I got something for ya, but it's a bit too heavy for you. Come back when you're Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2206580485" "Things are workin' out well, {VillainName}. This could be a profitable relationship. Speaking of profit, you check out my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store?</a> Call me any time."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3386079522" "You're alright, {VillainName}. Things are workin' out very nicely! A big mover and shaker like you ought to have the best Enhancements. Right, buddy? So check out what I got to sell anytime!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P353939237" "Alright, I don't wanna get you in no more trouble. I'll let you go your own way."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P865642239" "There's someone you might want to meet.  His name is Billie Heck, and word is that he does some work for the Family from time to time."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2240183781" "Choose Billie Heck"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2879687874" "Billie comes off as a bit of a weasel, but he might have some work for you if you need it."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3740288109" "I know <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</a> who has some work for you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P760382591" "Some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> I know may be able to help you out."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


