// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Mr_Bocor 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Mr. Bocor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3892764569" "Mr. Bocor"
// ProfessionString :
"P1858667886" "Vodoun priest"
// DescriptionString :
"P434439020" "Very little is known about Mr. Bocor. Even his first name is a closely guarded secret, as Bocor understands that names have great power. He's a student of power in general. As a Vodoun priest, Bocor came to Port Oakes eager to learn the secrets of the mysterious ghosts that haunt its shores. But he's not immune to the call of more earthly power, such as that wielded by the Family. Mr. Bocor has his hand into just about everything going on in Port Oakes. Which makes him a dangerous adversary, or a powerful ally."
// HelloString :
"P4111293642" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Good day. We have much to do.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P868544411" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I require your assistance.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1775984549" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Interested in an opportunity?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2757404264" "We are strangers, you and I, and I have heard nothing of your deeds. Speak with a broker if you would like to increase your reputation. They're on the map."
// FirstVisitString :
"P381367189" "It is an honor to meet you, {VillainName}. I am Mr. Bocor. You will call me Mr. Bocor. As long as we maintain a healthy respect for one another, we should be able to work toward our mutual benefit."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1727656528" "I have nothing more for you, {VillainName}. You had best be on your way."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P4282880405" "You are already well occupied. I cannot trust you with another scheme."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1070746680" "I have something, but you are not yet ready. Perhaps when you reach Threat Level {Level}, we can discuss it."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P6286906" "I am beginning to like you, {VillainName}. You know how to get the job done."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2936715214" "I think I can trust you with something a bit more dicey, {VillainName}. You have proved your worth to me."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1987818953" "I'm afraid we can't help each other any longer. Best to part ways."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1447829385" "Have you met Mr. Bocor yet? Almost everyone on Port Oakes knows him, or at least knows of him. According to rumor, he's an immensely powerful Vodoun sorcerer. I'd stay on his good side, if I were you. Mr. Bocor can be a powerful ally."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3950568002" "Choose Mr. Bocor"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1141869954" "Mr. Bocor may not seem like a threat. But there's more to him than meets the eye."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2937569630" "This is a world of many wonders, my friend, and I expect that one of them will be of interest to you. It is a simple <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>radio</a> on a shelf. Strange, I know, but seek it out."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1859647705" "A couple of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>acquaintances</a> have expressed a wish to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


