// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : The Radio 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4080933560" "The Radio"
// ProfessionString :
"P3182679213" "An innocous radio"
// DescriptionString :
"P4019152635" "Rumor has it every now and then, a mysterious voice speaks through this seemingly innocuous radio. According to the rumors, the things the voice says can lead to great opportunity to those that listen in."
// HelloString :
"P4059910743" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>All you hear at first is the sounds of pop radio.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2451941643" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>The Radio seems to be tuned to an indie rock station.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2619093114" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>The Radio seems to be tuned to a Country and Western station.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P4001535863" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>The Radio seems to be tuned to a Mexican radio station.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1747675595" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>The Radio seems to be tuned to a Rap station.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3965599662" "This radio is playing music, just like any other off-the shelf radio would. It seems quite ordinary, but there's something strange here. You should seek out someone who knows about all manner of strangeness, someone like the mysterious Mr. Bocor."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3472482682" "As you approach the Radio, you briefly hear what sounds like another voice talking, just under the sound of the music. You mess with the dial to try and tune it in better."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4037527520" "This radio is playing music, just like any other off-the shelf radio would."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3416334270" "This radio is playing music, just like any other off-the shelf radio would. Maybe you should come back to it when you have fewer things to do, and can spend more time listening."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P993352927" "This radio is playing music, just like any other off-the shelf radio would. Maybe you should come back later. Perhaps after a few more levels."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P415293418" "The Radio seems to pick up in volume as you near it, though no one else seems to notice. Suddenly, you feel an urge to shop for <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a> You should check back soon."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2020722797" "The Radio seems to be talking only to you. Suddenly, you feel the urge to shop for <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3354903800" "No matter how you tune and adjust the Radio, it does nothing more than play regular music."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2014318890" "They say that there's a strange radio here in Port Oakes. According to rumors, sometimes a mysterious voice will speak through it, talking about great opportunities for those in the know."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3162571948" "Listen to the Radio"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1774217252" "I know it sounds weird, but the rumors say that those who listen to what that Radio have to say can find great rewards."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2401610801" "There's a strange ad on the Radio, talking about <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>meeting someone</A> influential in your area."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P4013088162" "There's a strange ad on the Radio, talking about <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>meeting influential people</A> in your area."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


