// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Veluta Lunata 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2287312326" "Veluta Lunata"
// ProfessionString :
"P1465041419" "Fortunata"
// DescriptionString :
"P2774917900" "Formerly one of Ghost Widow's personal aides, Veluta Lunata fell out of favor when she was discovered having an affair with an Arachnos soldier. As a test of Veluta's loyalty, Ghost Widow ordered her to kill the young man. Veluta did as she was bidden and slew the man she loved. Impressed, Ghost Widow took pity on her and told her how to bind the soldier's soul to herself for all eternity. Currently, Veluta is tasked with monitoring the Arachnos ghost research program on Port Oakes. She hopes someday to work her way back into Ghost Widow's good graces."
// HelloString :
"P4183975520" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We have much to do.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P218114779" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Ghost Widow is impatient for progress.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2473625390" "I deal in ghosts, {VillainName}. If you wish to be of use to me, you will have to prove you have the wherewithal to stand before them. Defeat the ghosts that haunt Port Oakes. Only then can we work together."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4065944010" "If you and I are going to work together, you need to understand one thing. I am out for myself. Accept that, and we'll work well together. Try to change me, and you may end up like Marco here."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3572729933" "We've got nothing more to say to each other."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3652165540" "I'm not putting you on my payroll when you've already got a full plate."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1292842538" "I've got something, but I'm not sure I can trust it to you. Maybe after you hit Threat Level 10."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1969263403" "You've proved your skill, {VillainName}, although your loyalty is still in question. I will allow you greater access to my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store,</a> but I would like you to call in frequently."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1848410494" "I'm beginning to believe we may develop a friendship, of a sort. I am willing to sell you all the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> at my disposal."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3710417060" "I'm not messing with you, {VillainName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1794074329" "There's someone who may be able to help you: Veluta Lunata. She is a powerful woman. She has great knowledge of the ghosts here in Port Oakes, though she is not always willing to part with it."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1388608922" "Choose Veluta Lunata"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3613045229" "Veluta has a sad story to tell."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P24739911" "I know <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</a> who has the info you need."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

